# Web testing

When changing the Vue frontend under `src/`:

1. Prefer tests next to the code or under `src/**/__tests__/` / `e2e/`.
2. New logic gets unit (Vitest) and/or component (Vue Test Utils) coverage; critical UI flows use Playwright.
3. Before finishing a stage: `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, `npm run build`; for UI flows also `npm run test:e2e`.
4. Do not delete or weaken tests only to make CI green.

Playwright selectors: roles / accessible name; otherwise a stable `data-testid`.
